{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/870fd6c0dd5c779fb4396c666756e412.avif?t=1754663868\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/38e7edb02df98e366ef5b85c72e902f6.avif?t=1754663868\" width=800 height=342 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/870fd6c0dd5c779fb4396c666756e412.avif?t=1754663868\" width=616 height=38 /></span><strong>Park of Hidden Desires</strong> is a magical story-driven adventure set in a mysterious city park, where every shadow holds a secret and every path leads to a new discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a quirky ghost detective, forever bound to this park until all the hidden desires of its visitors are fulfilled.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/870fd6c0dd5c779fb4396c666756e412.avif?t=1754663868\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/79bc814980894ab0a0c266725524df0e.poster.avif?t=1754663868\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/79bc814980894ab0a0c266725524df0e.webm?t=1754663868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/79bc814980894ab0a0c266725524df0e.mp4?t=1754663868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/870fd6c0dd5c779fb4396c666756e412.avif?t=1754663868\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, the park is alive with laughter, romance, and lively conversations along sunlit paths. When night falls, lanterns begin to glow, fireflies drift through the air, and the most cherished dreams and secrets awaken under the trees. You are an invisible observer, able to eavesdrop on secret conversations, peek at romantic encounters, help lost children, or unravel the motives of mysterious strangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/870fd6c0dd5c779fb4396c666756e412.avif?t=1754663868\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/d81afe82e69db723473845bbba095ce4.poster.avif?t=1754663868\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/d81afe82e69db723473845bbba095ce4.webm?t=1754663868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/d81afe82e69db723473845bbba095ce4.mp4?t=1754663868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/870fd6c0dd5c779fb4396c666756e412.avif?t=1754663868\" width=616 height=38 /></span>Explore winding trails, uncover hidden stories, solve engaging puzzles, and help characters fulfill their deepest wishes. Every choice you make influences the story and the atmosphere of the park\u2014some secrets come to light, while others slip away into the shadows.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/870fd6c0dd5c779fb4396c666756e412.avif?t=1754663868\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/075c5b530e4bec15a2d8bf9ea0cad639.poster.avif?t=1754663868\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/075c5b530e4bec15a2d8bf9ea0cad639.webm?t=1754663868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/075c5b530e4bec15a2d8bf9ea0cad639.mp4?t=1754663868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/870fd6c0dd5c779fb4396c666756e412.avif?t=1754663868\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines charming hand-drawn graphics, fluid animation, and an atmospheric soundtrack to immerse you in a world of mysteries, emotions, and unexpected encounters. Interact with unique characters, uncover their fates, restore broken bonds, and change the lives of the park\u2019s inhabitants for the better\u2026 or not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an invisible guardian, helping lost souls find their way, or meddle in their destinies, changing their wishes forever. In this park, everyone has a dream\u2014and every dream has its own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets, desires, and smiles hidden in the shadows of <strong>Park of Hidden Desires</strong>\u2014where every wish matters, and every secret has its own fate.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883990?t=1754663868","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883990?t=1754663868","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/388c31d0016bdb2efb2c7a9fcf948a897e1cfd02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754663868","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/388c31d0016bdb2efb2c7a9fcf948a897e1cfd02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754663868","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of romance, eroticism, and sexual content between adult characters. Elements of nudity and sensuality are presented in an artistic and narrative context and are not intended for minors. All characters involved in explicit or romantic scenes are adults. The game does not contain any scenes of violence or cruelty. All erotic content is depicted in an artistic and story-driven manner."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/870fd6c0dd5c779fb4396c666756e412.avif?t=1754663868\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/38e7edb02df98e366ef5b85c72e902f6.avif?t=1754663868\" width=800 height=342 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883990/extras/870fd6c0dd5c779fb4396c666756e412.avif?t=1754663868\" width=616 height=38 /></span><strong>Park of Hidden Desires</strong> is a magical story-driven adventure set in a mysterious city park, where every shadow holds a secret and every path leads to a new discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a quirky ghost detective, forever bound to 